okular-session (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add independent package revision numbers and checksum-based asset selection.
  * Include a manual generated from README and Debian copyright metadata.
  * Generate a standalone Arch recipe with verified source checksums.
  * Use stable build paths and explicit packager metadata.
  * Check package metadata, reproducibility, installation, upgrade, and removal.
  * Publish complete draft releases and refuse to overwrite existing releases.

